  "extract": "In deep learning, fine-tuning is the process of adapting a computational model trained for one task to perform a different, usually more specific, task. It is considered a form of transfer learning, as it reuses knowledge learned from the original training objective.",
  "extract_html": "<p>In deep learning, <b>fine-tuning</b> is the process of adapting a computational model trained for one task to perform a different, usually more specific, task. It is considered a form of transfer learning, as it reuses knowledge learned from the original training objective.</p>"
